  "title": "Stevie J's Baby Mama, Joseline Hernandez Wasted No-Time Taking A Shot At 21 Savage $75,000 Smile",
  "htmlContent": "<!-- wp:image {\"id\":510808,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/GettyImages-1174323068-682x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-510808\"/><figcaption>NEW YORK, NEW YORK - SEPTEMBER 12: 21 Savage attends Rihanna's 5th Annual Diamond Ball at Cipriani Wall Street on September 12, 2019 in New York City. (Photo by Steven Ferdman/Getty Images)</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>On Monday, 21, Savage took To Twitter to inform his fans that he spent $75k for his brand new smile. And he would be damned if anyone said that his teeth weren't his. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>\"I paid 75k I’ll be dammed if I let y’all say these teeth ain’t mine,\" said 21 Savage.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/21savage/status/1374163922073350147?s=20\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true,\"className\":\"\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/21savage/status/1374163922073350147?s=20\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Hollywood Unlocked caught wind of the post and featured it on their Instagram with the caption \"21 Savage said y’all better leave him and his $75K pearly whites alone!.\"  The post gained some traction and Steve J's Baby mother, Joseline Hernandez saw the post and proceed to make fun of 21 Savage new teeth, \"Not for the horsis [horses]. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://www.instagram.com/p/CMvpGuOBxwF/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"instagram\",\"responsive\":true,\"className\":\"\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-instagram wp-block-embed-instagram\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://www.instagram.com/p/CMvpGuOBxwF/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":510805,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/162919693_196665465216175_7649689401056087342_n.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-510805\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A user by the name of 'aaanilve_' replied to Hernandez with the comment \"girl you look like a whole horsi\". </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><gwmw style=\"display:none;\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":510807,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/163586437_123102919768628_7152254211448014803_n-505x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-510807\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Over the weekend, the Atlanta-based rapper posted photos of him smiling on vacation. Of course, his fans took notice of his pearly white in place of his patent grill. 21 Savage is the latest hip-hop artist to remove his grill. Earlier this year, Fort Myers, Florida-based artist Piles, showed off his new look.<gwmw style=\"display:none;\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/plies/status/1350083821954355200?s=20\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true,\"className\":\"\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/plies/status/1350083821954355200?s=20\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>\"I Just Showed My Mom My New Smile. She Hugged Me, Started Crying &amp; Said, “I Finally Got My Baby Back.” One Of The Proudest Days Of My Life. 2021 I’m Might Just Turn Into A Full-Time Brand Ambassador With This New Smile No Coochie Gettin Ate With These (Ladies) How Did I Do?\"</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As for 21, his Louis Vuitton summer Men's Collection created by Virgil Abloh debuted in stores last week, according to <a href=\"https://www.lofficielusa.com/men/21-savage-louis-vuitton-virgil-abloh\">Lucie René of lofficielusa.com</a>. So, make sure you buy a fit and add it to your collection. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
